<title>USA: Hallwood Group completes tender offer.</title>
<headline>Hallwood Group completes tender offer.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hallwood Group Inc said on Monday that more than 87,500 shares of Hallwood Energy Corp were tendered under the tender offer which expired on Nov 22.</p>
<p>As a result of these tenders, Hallwood Group said it now holds more than 92 percent of the total outstanding shares of Hallwood Energy, and plans to immediately consummate the merger of Hallwood Energy into Hallwood Group.</p>
</text>
